<h2 style="margin:0 0 12px 0;font-size:19px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:600;color:#111827;letter-spacing:-0.25px;">
  Verify your work email
</h2>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;color:#4b5563;">
  Hi {{recipientName}}, enter the 6-digit verification code below to confirm your email and finish creating <strong style="color:#111827;font-weight:600;">{{workspaceContext}}</strong>.
</p>

<div style="margin:0 0 24px 0;padding:20px 24px;background-color:#f9fafb;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:10px;text-align:center;">
  <span style="font-family:'SFMono-Regular',Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;font-size:30px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:10px;color:#111827;padding-left:10px;">{{otpCode}}</span>
</div>

<p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#6b7280;">
  This code expires in <strong style="color:#374151;font-weight:600;">{{expiresMinutes}} minutes</strong> and can only be used once. If you didn&rsquo;t sign up for this workspace, you can safely ignore this email.
</p>
